+/*
+ * IOSCSIController.m (plan 320).
+ *
+ * Written for this project from the OPENSTEP 4.2 kernel bytes (D024,
+ * original module "Kernel/IOSCSIController.m", methods 0x1abaec-0x1ac296).
+ * The text is nearly the same as Darwin 0.1
